TEXT -104 8 Left 5 !.ac list 49.999 50 50.001
TEXT 488 -40 Left 5 !.param tdv=1 tdt=1 fn1=50 omega_n={2*pi*fn1} ; should always be present\n.options numdgt=10 plotwinsize=0 ; for accuracy .meas statements\n.options vntol=1m abstol=1u ; for accuracy voltage and current\n.options meascplxfmt=polar ; for meas AC values in polar format\n*.options logparams ; To put input parameters of all devices to the log file (Version>24.x)
TEXT -32 328 Left 4 ;400kV\nVoltagesource
TEXT 144 456 Left 6 ;Transformer\nwithout\nshunt reactor
TEXT 456 568 Left 6 ;Transformer\nwith\nshunt reactor
TEXT 784 568 Left 6 ;Two transformers \nin parallel\nand shunt reactor
TEXT 1392 560 Left 6 ;Two transformers\nin series and\nshunt reactor
TEXT 1112 200 Left 4 ;120kV\nVoltagesource
TEXT -120 744 Left 5 !; Reactive powers: (at Shuntreactor 1,2,3)\n.meas AC QSR_1  FIND 3*Ix(ShuntReactor1:L1)*v(bus4a:L1) at 50\n.meas AC QSR_2  FIND 3*Ix(ShuntReactor2:L1)*v(bus5a:L1) at 50\n.meas AC QSR_3  FIND 3*Ix(ShuntReactor3:L1)*v(bus7a:L1) at 50\n; Voltages: (at Shuntreactor 1,2,3)\n.meas AC VSR_1  FIND v(bus4:L1)  at 50\n.meas AC VSR_2  FIND v(bus5:L1) at 50\n.meas AC VSR_3  FIND v(bus7:L1) at 50\n; Currents: (at Shuntreactor 1,2,3)\n.meas AC ISR_1  FIND Ix(ShuntReactor1:L1) at 50\n.meas AC ISR_2  FIND Ix(ShuntReactor2:L1) at 50\n.meas AC ISR_3  FIND Ix(ShuntReactor3:L1) at 50
TEXT -112 624 Left 5 ;See the measurements:\nActivate schematic window\nView->Spice Output log\nScroll to the end of the file
